# ==============================================================================
# QUANTILE STEP 05b — Outlier investigation: are a few extreme std_resid values
#                      responsible for the E[u]=0 / skewness problems in Step 05?
# Paper_Quantile
# ==============================================================================
# Goal: Step 05 found mean_u far from 0 and extreme skewness for several crops
